<title>UK: World Bank sets NZ$200 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets NZ$200 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT     NZ$200 MLN   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    16.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.505   PAY DATE    16.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
